<gpx version="1.1" creator="Claude Bruce Trail planner" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
<metadata><name>Day 59 (stop 1 of 2) - Harrison Park, Palisades, Creamery Hill</name></metadata>
<wpt lat="44.545466" lon="-80.937276"><name>P Start/finish parking</name><desc>Harrison Park: Excellent free parking in Harrison Park in several places. Free</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.535420" lon="-80.936020"><name>P2 alternative parking</name><desc>Grey Sauble Conservation Authority Headquarters: Enter from Inglis Falls Rd. Free. Joins the route near km 2.6 (100 m walk).</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.550380" lon="-80.929490"><name>P3 alternative parking</name><desc>Roadside parking on the shoulder of 7th Ave E, where the Harrison Park Side Trail enters the…. Free. Joins the route near km 5.5 (0 m walk).</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.556780" lon="-80.925590"><name>P4 alternative parking</name><desc>Utility Tower Lot: On the west side of Highway 6 &amp;10 at the top of the hill above Owen Sound. Free. Joins the route near km 5.6 (1160 m walk).</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.538998" lon="-80.936232"><name>J1</name><desc>J1: Turn right onto the blue-blazed Creamery Hill Side Trail, heading south-west. (the blue-blazed Harrison Park Side Trail goes off ahead.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.534243" lon="-80.932512"><name>J2</name><desc>J2: Turn sharp left onto the white-blazed main Bruce Trail, heading north. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your left.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.542557" lon="-80.925541"><name>J3</name><desc>J3: Turn left onto the blue-blazed Palisades Side Trail, heading north-west. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your right.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.550481" lon="-80.928930"><name>J4</name><desc>J4: Turn right onto the blue-blazed Harrison Park Side Trail, heading south-east. (the blue-blazed Harrison Park Side Trail goes off on your left.) There is trailhead parking here (Roadside parking on the shoulder of 7th Ave E, where the Harrison Park Side Trail enters…).</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.550418" lon="-80.928074"><name>J5</name><desc>J5: Turnaround point. The side trail meets the white-blazed main Bruce Trail here. Turn around and retrace your steps.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
